11]}],"link":"108175","synopsis":"Juzo has been enjoying a peaceful school life, but that ends when Kazuma and Eiji transfer in, bringing the total number of assassins infiltrating his middle school to four. Meanwhile, the Home Ec Club holds a serious ramen-making contest. Paired with Noren, Juzo heads out to research ramen shops and saves a girl from being hit by a truck. But just who is she?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11704247/screencap/6a352618a7e0b.jpg"},{"title":"Life Paths","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19546","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"198113","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"62391","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"300131","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"467414","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"108253","synopsis":"Unicorn Mai Otohime is a marine-sports prodigy with expert-level ocean knowledge. She has come for a Mitsuoka Duel too, but her target is Juzo. This leads to Noren challenging Mai herself. As the duel nears, Juzo and the others face parent-teacher conferences and questions about their futures, leading Juzo to reflect on his school life, the friends he’s made, and the possibilities ahead.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11704248/screencap/6a3ec3b394342.jpg"}]},{"id":7783,"path":"/anime/7783-tougen-anki-nikko-kegon-falls-arc","info":{"title":"Tougen Anki: Nikko Kegon Falls Arc","synopsis":"Seconda stagione di Tougen Anki","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/204650-MpownoVlYv69.jpg","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/449843/posters/6872744220128.jpg","logo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/449843/clearlogo/693bfe33a7675.png","background":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/204650-MpownoVlYv69.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtu